title: "Reinterpreting Women's Leadership Metrics: Are We Correctly Measuring the Female Share of Management?"
abstract: "Compares the female share of management with the relative odds of women holding management positions in U.S. manufacturing across 2,779 local labor markets (CBSA x NAICS-3), using EEO-1, ACS, QWI and QCEW data."
